---
description: Recover permission records for each collection item and each distinct right.
args: { dossier: RightsDossier; change: RightsChange }
returns: CollectionPermission[]
---
Separate ownership, reproduction, copyright, online use, interview consent and attribution. Preserve permitted and prohibited uses, channels, audiences, duration, attribution conditions and expiry. If an owner is not the rights holder, record the missing rights separately; never infer a grant.
